OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Flengthy clear spells this evening and
OL,7,Fovernight. Under the clearer skies
OL,8,Fthere is the chance of the odd mist
OL,9,Fand fog patch to form in some prone
OL,10,Frural spots, mainly in the west.
OL,11,FAnother cool night is likely.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FEarly mist and fog patches
OL,14,Fclearing to leave a fine and dry day,
OL,15,Fwith sunny spells. Feeling warm in the
OL,16,Fsunshine, with light winds. Cloudier
OL,17,Fovernight with some light rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
